  "name": "Southwestern Egg Rolls",
  "subtitle": "Crisp tortillas filled with seasoned chicken, vegetables, beans, spinach, and cheese.",
  "description": "Prepare a savory Southwestern filling, wrap it in flour tortillas, freeze until firm, then deep-fry until crisp and golden.",
